{
  "A list that stays on the page. One item or several are chosen with the keys or the pointer; items come from memory or from a data source, can be searched and grouped, and long lists draw only the rows in view.": "",
  "Several items": "",
  "With `selectionMode` set to `'multiple'` the value is an array, and every change writes a new one. Each switch below is a prop you can bind.": "",
  "Objects of your own are read through `textField` and `valueField`; `groupField` puts items under headers, `enabledField` keeps some from being chosen, and `itemTemplate` draws an item your way.": "",
  "With `dataSource` the list reads a `DataSource` of the data layer, and the search goes to it (its `searchFields`). In `'blocks'` mode only the rows in view load while the list scrolls; chosen values on rows not loaded yet stay chosen, and “Select all” loads the values of every matching row. This one holds 5,000 orders.": "",
  "The list is one Tab stop; the search box, when on, is another.": "",
  "Move the highlight; items that cannot be chosen are skipped. Single: the item is chosen too.": "",
  "The next item starting with it; letters typed quickly search together.": "",
  "Single: choose the highlighted item. Multiple: choose it or let it go.": "",
  "Multiple: move and choose or let go of the next item.": "",
  "Multiple: choose every item from the last one chosen to the highlighted one.": "",
  "Multiple: choose every item from the highlighted one to the first / last.": "",
  "Multiple: choose every item, or none when all are chosen.": "",
  "Go to the list.": "",
  "Multiple: add or take away one item; choose the items between.": "",
  "The APG listbox: the list is `role=\"listbox\"`, focused itself; `aria-activedescendant` names the highlighted option.": "",
  "`role=\"option\"` with `aria-selected`; disabled ones `aria-disabled`. Multiple lists are `aria-multiselectable`.": "",
  "The label names the list (`aria-labelledby`); help and errors describe it, `aria-invalid` and `aria-required` tell its state.": "",
  "Only the rows in view are drawn; each option says where it is with `aria-posinset` and `aria-setsize`; rows still loading are `aria-busy`.": "",
  "The highlight shows while the list is in use; with the keys it also gets the focus ring.": "",
  "“Select all”, the search box, “No items” and “Loading…” come from `uiLocale.strings` (`selectAll`, `search`, `noItems`, `loading`).": "",
  "Added to the field. `data-selection-mode`, `data-check-boxes`; the field attributes of TextBox.": "",
  "The search box.": "",
  "The list (shared), its options (`data-active`, `data-selected`), group headers and check boxes.": "",
  "The \"Select all\" row; `data-mixed` when some items are chosen.": "",
  "Units: the space around the list box, and around and between its search box and list.": "",
  "Unit: the check box of a row in a list of several choices (`checked`, `disabled`, `checked-disabled`).": "",
  "Units: the ring round the row the keys are on (`selected`), and that row while the list is not in use.": "",
  "Places: the field, the search box and the list inside a list box (the list's and the field's own units, as they look here).": "",
  "The rows, as for DropDown: height, padding, highlight, chosen item, headers, \"Select all\".": "",
  "The chosen value (single) or values (multiple). `x-model` binds it; a change writes a new array.": "",
  "Items in memory, searched here, or a data source of `@motifx-community/data`, searched where it lives. A data source wins.": "",
  "A property name or a function `(item) => …`. Plain values are their own text and value.": "",
  "An icon per item; headers between groups (items in memory); items that cannot be chosen.": "",
  "One value, or an array of them.": "",
  "Multiple: check boxes in front of the items; `false` draws a check mark, and a plain click chooses only that item.": "",
  "Multiple: a \"Select all\" row that is checked, empty or shows a dash.": "",
  "Single: the arrow keys choose as they move. Off: they only move, Space or Enter chooses.": "",
  "A search box above the list.": "",
  "How items in memory match the search.": "",
  "Rows (`8`) or a CSS length (`\"12rem\"`). Without it the list is as high as its items, up to the list’s `max-height` (`list.container`).": "",
  "Draws an item your way.": "",
  "What an empty list says instead of `uiLocale`’s “No items”.": "",
  "The items of the chosen values that are known; with a data source the others are asked by key and follow.": "",
  "The search `TextBox` while `searchEnabled` is on.": "",
  "Multiple: chooses every item the list shows (a data source: after their values load).": "",
  "Chooses nothing.": "",
  "Brings an item into view and highlights it.": "",
  "Your items may be plain or reactive; the list reads them as they are. After changing them in place, call `refresh()`. It reads which items there are, their texts and values, and the chosen ones again.": ""
}
